    "chunk_size_bytes": 2087,
    "chunk_text": "[6.57 p.m.] \u0dd9\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5 \u0dbd\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dc2\u0db1\u0db8\u0db1\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d87\u0dc0\u0dbd\u0dbd \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba3\u0bbf \u0bb2\u0b95\u0bcd\u0bb7\u0bcd\u0bc8\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bbf\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0b8e\u0bb2\u0bcd\u0bb2) (The Hon. Lakshman Kiriella, Attorney-at-Law) Hon. Speaker, I wish to associate myself with the sentiments expressed by the Hon. Prime Minister, the Leader of the Opposition and the Leader of the House.\n\nParticularly, during the COVID crisis, he showed his sporting capabilities; he looked after the MPs as well as everyone in Parliament and safeguarded the integrity of the House. At the same time, I would like to say that we used to meet him at the Party Leaders\u2019 Meeting. He is a very courteous person. He is a very decent, civilized and a cultured person. I think everyone in this House appreciated that.\n\nSo, without much ado, I would like to wish him and his family all the success in life in the future. I am sure, with his all-round ability as a graduate and with his sporting capabilities, he might be gainfully employed in the future to his satisfaction.\n\nThank you.\n\n359 360\n\n2024 \u0da2\u0db1 \u0dc1\u0dd2 54\n\n\u0dd9\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) The Hon. Rauff Hakeem. [6.59 p.m.]\n\n\u0dd9\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0dc6\u0db1 \u0dc4\u0d9a\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba3\u0bbf \u0bb1\u0bb5\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd \u0bb9\u0b95\u0bc0\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. Rauff Hakeem, Attorney-at-Law) Hon. Speaker, I, too, associate myself with the sentiments expressed by the other Hon. Members in wishing Mr. Narendra Fernando a contended retired life. I am sure, he will - as has been mentioned by other Hon. Members - carry with him some of those precious memories which are rare in public life.\n\nHe is someone who has a rounded personality. I have had the privilege of being involved with him even in sports outside this House and having come to this House, I have been able to see him as somebody who has served with such dedication for the last 42 years."
  },
