    "chunk_text": "Surely, there is something wrong here! This is a Navy which, at every opportunity, boasts that they managed to destroy the LTTE and the LTTE\u2019s naval capacity. Well, here, you have a situation where you have strengthened the Navy\u2019s presence in the North and the East, When the LTTE was there, you did not have this presence; today, you have strengthened their presence in the North and the East. You are getting so many donations from various other navies, various other countries to strengthen your naval capacity and despite that, these foreign fishermen are allowed to come. It is because they are allowed to come, not because of anything else. So, that is the reality, Sir. During the war, there was a ban on fishing. Then, after the war, you are deliberately allowing foreign fishermen to come in and destroy the assets of the local fishermen in the North and the East. It cannot be any other reason than to deliberately destroy their existence, their livelihood so that they would leave that land and then, you could grab that land, which you already illegally occupy. That has to be the only reason.\n\noperated? It is the Minister\u2019s goons, people who have nothing to do with fishing or with that area. They are the ones who are entitled to be given those licences and in the process of those licences being granted, again, the fishing infrastructure in that area is being destroyed. So, in every way possible, the livelihoods of the fisherfolk are being destroyed."
