    "chunk_text": "operated? It is the Minister\u2019s goons, people who have nothing to do with fishing or with that area. They are the ones who are entitled to be given those licences and in the process of those licences being granted, again, the fishing infrastructure in that area is being destroyed. So, in every way possible, the livelihoods of the fisherfolk are being destroyed.\n\nSo, that is what is happening. I do not know what the case is in the South, but definitely in the North and the East, this economic crisis is being used deliberately to disenfranchise the local population\u2019s economy to a point that they are forced to leave this land, to somehow try and escape so that they could at least survive. And that, obviously, must be the agenda of this Government, Sir.\n\nIt is in this backdrop that elections are going to come up. This Government is behaving in such an oppressive way, but we have nothing coming from the Opposition, whichever party that may be. They know what is actually happening there, they know how this Government is deliberately acting in a way to destroy the livelihoods of our people, but they have no voice to stand up and say that this is what is happening. Therefore, Sir, these elections that the people in the North and the East are going to face will be an acid test, where the people, this time, could very clearly demonstrate what their opinion is with regard to how they have been treated in the last 15 years since the end of the war. And, it is on that basis, Sir, that we urge the Tamil people to use the opportunity of the elections that are coming up to give a very clear message to everybody who is taking them for granted.\n\nI thank you, Sir. \u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf \u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 . .\u0db6\u0dd3. \u0dc1\u0db1\u0dda\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca \u0dbb\u0daf\u0da2\u0dba \u0dad\u0db8\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dd2\u0db8\u0daf. \u0dc3\u0db6\u0db8\u0dd2\u0db8\u0daf\u0da7 \u0dc0\u0dd2 \u0daf\u0da9\u0dd2 10\u0dca \u0dca\u0daf\u0dbd\u0dbd\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db6 \u0dc0\u0daf.\n\n693 694\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd3\u0dba.\u0dd3\u0dba. \u0dc1\u0db4\u0ddc\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd4\u0db6\u0dbd\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dad\u0daf]\n\n]0]4 \u0dc1\u0db4\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0daf\u0dbb\u0dd2 ]1"
